WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:12.400
Narrator: Some incidents are serious enough to need the emergency services and a plan from the VOC: a fire, a damaged structure, a crush or serious disorder, a security threat, a gas leak.

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:21.500
Narrator: They may start in just one area - so report the warning signs at once; don't wait for the whole match to be disrupted.

3
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:31.430
Narrator: The VOC, with the agencies, decide what kind of incident it is and what happens next.

4
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:40.930
Narrator: Fans may be held where they are, moved to a safer area inside, or evacuated - from one area, one stand or the whole stadium.

